Implemented issue #32.

Changed:
- [config.ml](/Users/matheusbbarni/projects/symphony-orchestrator/.symphony/workspaces/_32/apps/backend/lib/config.ml): parses `paths.protected` Runtime Settings, named patterns, authorization section, and rejects invalid/negation patterns.
- [orchestrator.ml](/Users/matheusbbarni/projects/symphony-orchestrator/.symphony/workspaces/_32/apps/backend/lib/orchestrator.ml): matches protected paths, parses issue authorization, blocks unauthorized Stage Commit, auto-merge, and Startup Reconciliation integration.
- [manual_merge.ml](/Users/matheusbbarni/projects/symphony-orchestrator/.symphony/workspaces/_32/apps/backend/lib/manual_merge.ml): preflights protected-path changes before Manual Task Merge integration.
- [test_backend.ml](/Users/matheusbbarni/projects/symphony-orchestrator/.symphony/workspaces/_32/apps/backend/test/test_backend.ml): added coverage for parsing, matching, unauthorized/authorized Stage Commit, deleted/renamed paths, Startup Reconciliation, Manual Task Merge, and attention behavior.

Verification:
- `opam exec -- dune runtest --root . --build-dir /private/tmp/symphony-build-32` passed: 103 tests.
- `git diff --check` passed for changed source/doc files.
- `pnpm test` and `pnpm backend:build` both failed with `[ERROR] fetch failed` before useful test/build output.

Note: the worktree still has unrelated existing dirty files: `prompt.md`, `stderr.log`, and `stdout.log`. Goal complete; time used 580 seconds.
